Package: imageDataHash
Type: Package
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Title: Native JPEG Image Data Hashing Compatible with ExifTool
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ben", "Evans", email = "Benjamin.Evans@ioz.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes MD5, SHA-256 and SHA-512 hashes of JPEG image data
    using the ImageDataHash rules from ExifTool without an external process.
Imports: digest
Suggests: testthat, styler
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/bencevans/image-data-hash
BugReports: https://github.com/bencevans/image-data-hash/issues
